{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Airfleet - your own airline is in your hands! Manage every aspect of the business: from thoughtful route planning to precise crew selection, every decision affects the reputation and efficiency of the company.<br><br>In this demo version you will be able to try out 3 game maps and basic game mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/Routes_En.png?t=1744131407\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/gif3.gif?t=1744131407\" />Create an extensive transportation network, combining major international terminals with cozy provincial airfields. Optimize connections and logistics, turning each airport into a vital hub for your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/Passengers_En.png?t=1744131407\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/gif2.gif?t=1744131407\" />Choose your strategy: become a leader in mass budget transportation or create an elite service for demanding customers. A variety of classes allows you to customize comfort and pricing, gaining passenger trust and loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/Fleet_En.png?t=1744131407\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/gif1.gif?t=1744131407\" />Build a unique fleet of more than 11 detailed recreations of civilian vehicles from around the world. Transport passengers on modern airliners, regional jets and fuel-efficient turboprops to meet every demand.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/Theme_En.png?t=1744131407\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/gif4.gif?t=1744131407\" />Use the color theme customization to make the look of the game pleasing to you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2565230?t=1744131407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/b68b4f77c48624bdcfcb91c0fc2ad34618f20e9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744131407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/5992b885e4d49226acccb453148ebf3f8534051a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744131407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/5992b885e4d49226acccb453148ebf3f8534051a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744131407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Airfleet - your own airline is in your hands! Manage every aspect of the business: from thoughtful route planning to precise crew selection, every decision affects the reputation and efficiency of the company.<br><br>In this demo version you will be able to try out 3 game maps and basic game mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/Routes_En.png?t=1744131407\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2565230/extras/gif3.gif?t=1744131407\" />Create an extensive transportation network, combining major international terminals with cozy provincial airfields. Optimize connections and logistics, turning each airport into a vital hub for your empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co